  "releaseNotes": "# AID Studio v3.0.2\n\n## 中文\n\n### 新增\n\n- 模型可选择使用专属连接。未启用时继续使用供应商连接；修改连接时，在途任务保留原有连接版本。\n- 后台新增模型请求日志，可按类型开启，筛选记录并按需查看过滤凭证后的请求、响应正文。支持设置存储位置、保留天数和容量，默认全部关闭。\n- 后台图片和视频模型测试先展示测试规格及预估积分，确认后真实生成并展示结果；文本模型测试可查看实际返回内容。\n- 自由画布支持将框选的多个节点连接到同一个下游节点，并支持一次撤销。点击素材缩略图的 @ 可在提示词光标处插入引用。\n\n### 优化\n\n- 调整深浅主题的品牌高亮与中性色，改善充值弹窗购买按钮的文字可读性。\n\n### 修复\n\n- 修复本地存储图片已可在线预览，但作为流程视频参考图时仍被判为不可用的问题。\n- 修复使用 HTTP 访问时，3D 预演工程保存、产物校验及部分画布操作因缺少浏览器加密接口而失败的问题。\n- 安装器无法读取重装确认时会明确失败；可用内存不足时会在启动 Maven 前提示，避免进入无效构建。\n\n### 兼容性与升级注意事项\n\n- 最低升级版本为 2.2.4。该版本升级前仍需按 3.0.0 升级文档备份并整理历史 Skill 标识。\n- 已有模型默认不启用专属连接，既有供应商配置和模型状态予以保留。请持续保留部署密钥，以便读取已保存的专属连接。\n- 模型请求日志默认关闭，管理员按需要开启并设置保留策略；关闭后已有日志继续遵循保留策略。\n- 后台真实模型测试可能消耗上游渠道额度，需确认后执行；不扣平台测试用户的积分。\n\n## English\n\n### Added\n\n- Models can use a dedicated connection. Existing models retain their provider connection by default, and in-flight tasks keep the connection revision they started with.\n- Administrators can opt in to model request logs by type, filter records, and load credential-filtered request and response bodies on demand. Storage location, retention, and capacity are configurable. All types are off by default.\n- Image and video model tests show the test specification and estimated cost before confirmation, then generate and display an actual result. Text model tests show the real response.\n- Canvas can connect multiple selected nodes to one downstream node and undo the operation in one step. The @ action on a reference thumbnail inserts a mention at the prompt cursor.\n\n### Improved\n\n- Updated brand highlights and neutral surfaces in light and dark themes, including readable purchase-button text in the recharge dialog.\n\n### Fixed\n\n- Fixed locally stored images that could be previewed but were rejected as references for workflow videos.\n- Fixed saving 3D preview projects, checking artifacts, and related Canvas operations when HTTP access does not provide the browser cryptography API.\n- The installer now fails clearly when reinstall confirmation cannot be read and checks available memory before starting Maven.\n\n### Compatibility and upgrade notes\n\n- The minimum upgrade version remains 2.2.4. Follow the 3.0.0 upgrade guide to back up and normalize legacy Skill identifiers before upgrading from that version.\n- Dedicated connections are disabled for existing models. Existing provider settings and model states are preserved. Keep the deployment secret available to read saved dedicated connections.\n- Request logging is off by default. Administrators choose which types to enable and set retention. Disabling capture does not bypass retention for existing logs.\n- Real model tests may consume upstream provider quota and require confirmation. They do not charge the platform test user's credits.",
